      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion-list">
        <!-- Q1 -->
        <details class="faq-accordion-item" open>
          <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">
            <span>How does AdhocX guarantee 100% yellow-plate commercial cab compliance?</span>
            <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-accordion-content">
            AdhocX enforces a strict zero-tolerance policy against private white-plate vehicles. Every commercial cab on our platform must have an active RTO commercial permit, valid passenger vehicle fitness certificate, commercial insurance, and verified driver background checks. Unregistered vehicles are digitally blocked from receiving trip assignments.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- Q2 -->
        <details class="faq-accordion-item">
          <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">
            <span>How does AdhocX enforce night-shift female employee escort protocols?</span>
            <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-accordion-content">
            Under Telangana State Labor Regulations, trips between 8:00 PM and 6:00 AM carrying female employees automatically trigger mandatory security escort allocation. The platform guarantees female commuters are neither picked up first nor dropped off last alone, tracks the route in real-time, and sends automated safe-drop SMS verification to company administrators.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- Q3 -->
        <details class="faq-accordion-item">
          <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">
            <span>Can our company retain existing transport suppliers and negotiated rates?</span>
            <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-accordion-content">
            Yes. AdhocX functions as enterprise orchestration software, not a restrictive vendor monopoly. You can keep your existing contracted transport vendors and pre-negotiated rate cards. We provide the software to route shifts, monitor driver SLAs, automate digital duty slips, and consolidate monthly billing.
          </div>
        </details>

